        "fr": "formal"
      },
      "styleGuide": {
        "fr": "Follow docs/translation-style/fr.md: native French travel-writer voice for France, Belgium, Switzerland and Canada, formal vous, French typography (non-breaking spaces before : ; ? !, « » quotes), French state names, no calques, no offline-map claims."
